            <h2 style="font-size:2.2rem;font-weight:800;color:#212121;margin-top:16px;">Everything a Farmer Needs</h2>
            <p style="color:#757575;max-width:500px;margin:12px auto 0;">Smart digital tools that make farming easier, more productive and profitable.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon" style="background:#E8F5E9;">🤖</div>
                    <h5 style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px;">AI Farming Advisor</h5>
                    <p style="color:#757575;font-size:0.875rem;margin:0;">Ask any farming question in Gujarati and get instant expert AI answers 24/7.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon" style="background:#FFF8E1;">📷</div>
                    <h5 style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px;">Disease Detection</h5>
                    <p style="color:#757575;font-size:0.875rem;margin:0;">Upload crop photo for instant AI disease diagnosis with treatment recommendations.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon" style="background:#E3F2FD;">☁</div>
                    <h5 style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px;">Weather Advisory</h5>
                    <p style="color:#757575;font-size:0.875rem;margin:0;">Real-time weather with farming-specific alerts for rain, heat, and wind.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon" style="background:#EFEBE9;">🎤</div>
                    <h5 style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px;">Voice Query</h5>
                    <p style="color:#757575;font-size:0.875rem;margin:0;">Speak your question in Gujarati — our AI understands and responds instantly.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon" style="background:#F3E5F5;">📜</div>
                    <h5 style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px;">Government Schemes</h5>
                    <p style="color:#757575;font-size:0.875rem;margin:0;">Latest agriculture subsidies, loans, and insurance schemes at your fingertips.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon" style="background:#FFEBEE;">👨‍💼</div>
                    <h5 style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px;">Expert Escalation</h5>
                    <p style="color:#757575;font-size:0.875rem;margin:0;">Complex queries auto-forwarded to real Agriculture Officers for expert advice.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Stats Section -->
<section style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2E7D32,#43A047);padding:60px 0;">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row text-center text-white g-4">
            <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
                <div style="font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:800;">10K+</div>
                <div style="opacity:0.8;font-size:0.9rem;">Farmers Served</div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
                <div style="font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:800;">50K+</div>
                <div style="opacity:0.8;font-size:0.9rem;">AI Queries Answered</div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
                <div style="font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:800;">95%</div>
